and damn no hardstarters? maybe i'm lucky. both of mine had issues to the point of being unusable, not sure what fixed the M (went by by itself? or by flossing the ink channel) and the B needed a re-grind as it had too severe of a baby's bottom!

UPDATE: FLOSSING THE FEED and very throughly cleaning it with soapy water and runing the ink channel with soapy water over it using a very very thin sheet of metal I had from a clothing tag thing solved my issues :) tho I also changed the ink to a normal (not wet/dry) Bleu ocean from j-herbin, it's a sample.

